# data/processed/ IS tracked (unlike data/raw/): Render deploys straight from
# this repo with no build-time access to BLS (which has had multi-day
# outages during development), so the app needs its processed CSVs +
# trained model committed rather than regenerated at build time. Total is
# ~30MB, well within normal git limits. Re-run the src/ pipeline and commit
# the refreshed files whenever the underlying OEWS data changes.
